@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Service";
}

<div class="container my-4" style="max-width: 860px;">
    <div class="mb-4 pb-2 border-bottom">
        <h1 class="editorial-headline h2 mb-1">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Effective Date: November 2, 2026 &bull; NewsBase Publishing Group</p>
    </div>

    <div class="editorial-body">
        <p class="lead">
            Welcome to NewsBase. By accessing, reading, subscribing to, or submitting editorial content to our platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
        </p>

        <h4 class="h5 font-serif mt-4 mb-2">1. Editorial Standards &amp; Publication Integrity</h4>
        <p>
            NewsBase publishes independent news, investigative reports, commentary, and global wire digests. All content published by staff writers, guest contributors, and registered authors must adhere to ethical journalistic practices: accuracy, fair attribution, and transparency.
        </p>

        <h4 class="h5 font-serif mt-4 mb-2">2. Author Submissions &amp; Automated AI Review</h4>
        <p>
            When an author submits an article through the Author Studio:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>The submission is evaluated automatically by our Google Gemini AI editorial review system to detect policy violations, hate speech, vulgarity, harassment, and severe structural or quality deficiencies.</li>
            <li>Articles that pass editorial safety and depth standards are approved for publication. Articles that do not meet standards are set to Rejected with constructive editorial feedback, allowing the author to revise and resubmit.</li>
            <li>NewsBase reserves the final right to review, edit, unpublish, or retract any article that breaches legal or community standards.</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="h5 font-serif mt-4 mb-2">3. Reader Comments &amp; Community Guidelines</h4>
        <p>
            Registered readers are invited to participate in respectful public discussion on published stories. Comments containing hate speech, personal threats, defamation, obscenity, or commercial advertising will be removed by editorial staff.
        </p>

        <h4 class="h5 font-serif mt-4 mb-2">4. Intellectual Property &amp; Attribution</h4>
        <p>
            All original articles, editorial designs, and trademarks displayed on NewsBase are the property of NewsBase and its contributing journalists. Third-party wire dispatches accessed through Currents API remain the intellectual property of their original publishers and wires.
        </p>

        <h4 class="h5 font-serif mt-4 mb-2">5. Privacy &amp; Data Security</h4>
        <p>
            Your privacy is governed by our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. We utilize secure HTTP cookies strictly for authentication session tokens and CSRF protection.
        </p>

        <h4 class="h5 font-serif mt-4 mb-2">6. Corrections Policy</h4>
        <p>
            NewsBase promptly corrects factual errors in published reports. If you identify a factual inaccuracy in any article, please contact the editorial desk.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top text-muted small">
        Questions about these terms? Contact our editorial board at <code>editor@newsbase.org</code>.
    </div>
</div>
